    {
      "event": "recipe",
      "text": "Tao-v1 / Reality Plus-v2 Corp tune opened no game. Legal exact -1 Retribution/+1 Anoetic Void saved Retest Corp 19Nov, 44/8 influence/18 agenda. Tradeoff and support understandable."
    },
    {
      "event": "opening",
      "text": "Kept Hedge Fund/Palisade/economy/agendas. Played Hedge; Palisade HQ, Funhouse R&D. T2 exposed Regolith, rezzed, drew Hansei, discarded Send a Message to Hansei (strategic mistake: unprotected Archives), gaining funds. Runner trashed Regolith; now HQ approach, rez Palisade to stop no-breaker Runner."
    },
    {
      "event": "score-and-reinforce",
      "text": "Offworld scored UI turn4,2–0; Tao swap changed scoring protection. Orbital stolen turn5,2–2. Used Spin Doctor to recover discarded Send a Message and Hedge; installed Whitespace scoring remote and Tithe HQ instead of banking endlessly."
    },
    {
      "event": "support-and-tradeoff",
      "text": "Anoetic drawn/installed UI turn7; did not force activation. Public Trail turn9 tagged Runner, Reality Plus draw2, remaining Retribution trashed Cleaver. Actual effect demonstrates value of removed slot. Guide's HQ and credit reserve reminder used throughout."
    },
    {
      "event": "later-scoring",
      "text": "Offworld scored turn11,4–2 after Whitespace stopped remote run. Orbital scored turn13,6–2. Reassessed Tao swaps, played Hedge and reinforced scoring lane with second Whitespace, then installed Send a Message turn14."
    },
    {
      "event": "anoetic-window",
      "text": "Turn14 Runner wealthy enough to pass Whitespace; rezzed Tithe, fired effects, used Funhouse trigger and Reality Plus draw2. At movement-before-server rezzed Anoetic Void0. At approach triggered, paid2, trashed Funhouse and Hansei Review, ended run protecting Send a Message. Payment progress clear. Next turn chose Planogram income before advancing to retain defense budget."
    },
    {
      "event": "completed",
      "text": "Turn16 advanced Send a Message to5 and scored, Corp9 Runner2; natural agenda win, no concede/undo/restart, diagnostics[]. Notes updated under custom deck."
    }
